OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Sandbox Everything Available
Description	All base rooms and spells are available from the start, there is no room timer. Build your dungeon without a rival keeper. Open the sandbox panel to take heroes of any level in your hand or to call single and continual hero invasions. Nothing to win or lose.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
[/Info]

